\cf9 \cb14 With Watch Faces by Franck Muller Labs, it\'92s like getting a new high-end Swiss watch every day. \cb1 \
\
\cb14 DESIGNS\cb1 \
\cb14 Watch Faces by Franck Muller Labs curates collections of the best original designs and limited editions from the Swiss luxury watch brand.\cb1 \
\
\cb14 Franck Muller Labs's mechanical watchmaking complexities are conceived and developed in the heart of Switzerland. Throughout the production process of a timepiece, each step is meticulously thought out, from design to actual implementation.\cb1 \
\
\cb14 Frank Muller Labs is especially famous for being on the cutting edge of technological advancement. The Swiss manufacturer showcased the most recent advancements in blockchain technology with the prestigious Vanguard Encrypto.\cb1 \
\
\cb14 UNIQUE FEATURES\cb1 \
\cb14 Watch Faces by Franck Muller Labs is a collection that showcases animated digital watch faces for each and every aficionado. Many unique features come with each collection, such as an individualized QR code. With the help of that functionality, any user can establish their own unique link, functioning similarly to a digital business card.\cb1 \
\
\cb14 COMPATIBLE WITH ALL APPLE WATCHES \cb1 \
\cb14 Watch Faces by Franck Muller Labs is compatible with all Apple watches. \cb1 \
